62", "author_abbreviation": "Hdt.", "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; εἴη δ' ἂν πᾶν anything is possible, ib."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "195", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; πᾶν ποιῶν by any means whatever,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Pl. Ap. 39a", "author_abbreviation": "Pl.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(also πᾶν ποιεῖν καὶ λέγειν ibid. ; πᾶν ποιεῖν ὥστε . ."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Id. Phd. 114c", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "004", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "), cf."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Pi. I. 4(3).48", "author_abbreviation": "Pi.", "tlg_author": "0033", "tlg_work": "004", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "πᾶν ἂν ἔπραξαν Lys. 9.16", "author_abbreviation": "Lys.", "tlg_author": "0540", "tlg_work": "009", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ": more freq. in pl.,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "πάντα ποιῶν Id. 12.84", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0540", "tlg_work": "012", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ","}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "D. 21.2", "author_abbreviation": "D.", "tlg_author": "0014", "tlg_work": "021", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; π. ποιεῖν ὅπως . ."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "X. HG 7.4.21", "author_abbreviation": "X.", "tlg_author": "0032", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "πάντα τολμῶν S. OC 761", "author_abbreviation": "S.", "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "007", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; cf."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "A. 111.2", "author_abbreviation": "A.", "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". ἐπὶ πᾶν on the whole, in general,"}, {"kind": "citation"